<p><em>This is a translation provided for convenience. In case of discrepancy, the Spanish version prevails.</em></p>

<h2>1. What cookies are and who is responsible</h2>
<p>Cookies are small files a website stores in your browser to remember information about your visit, such as your language or that you are logged in. This policy explains which cookies @DatosLegales.SitioWeb uses, why, and how you can control them, under article 22.2 of Spanish Law 34/2002 (LSSI-CE) and the GDPR.</p>
<p>The controller is @DatosLegales.Titular (@DatosLegales.NombreComercial), tax ID @DatosLegales.Nif, address @DatosLegales.Domicilio. You can write to us at <a href="mailto:@DatosLegales.Email">@DatosLegales.Email</a>.</p>
<p>By purpose, we use two types of cookies:</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Technical:</strong> essential for the website and the application to work (logging in, submitting forms securely, remembering your language). They do not require your consent.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> let us know how many people visit the website and which pages they view, in aggregate, so we can improve it. They are only set if you accept them.</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not use advertising or social media cookies.</p>

<h2>2. Cookies we use</h2>
<h3>Technical cookies (our own, no consent required)</h3>
<div class="table-responsive">
<table class="table table-bordered">
    <thead><tr><th>Cookie</th><th>Owner</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>.AspNetCore.Antiforgery.*</code></td><td>Congrega</td><td>Protects forms against fraudulent submissions.</td><td>Session</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>.AspNetCore.Culture</code></td><td>Congrega</td><td>Remembers the chosen language (Spanish or English).</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>.AspNetCore.Cookies</code></td><td>Congrega</td><td>Keeps you logged in to the application.</td><td>Session</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>cg_consent</code></td><td>Congrega</td><td>Remembers whether you accepted or rejected cookies.</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
</div>

<h3>Analytics cookies (third-party, only with your consent)</h3>
